      "name": "edit",
      "description": "Edit the page snapshot using text replacement. Whitespace and newlines in oldText do not need to match exactly. Every edits[].oldText must still match a unique, non-overlapping region of the original file. If two changes affect the same block or nearby lines, merge them into one edit instead of emitting overlapping edits. Do not include large unchanged regions just to connect distant changes.",
      "parameters": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
